"strong_id__": "18121949857771948", "bit_flags": 0, "created_at": 1784777814, "created_at_utc": 1784777814, "did_report_as_spam": false, "is_ranked_comment": false, "pk": "18121949857771948", "share_enabled": false, "content_type": "comment", "media_id": "3947292043034375029", "status": "Active", "type": 1, "user_id": "2701519612", "text": "Dalam video CCTV yang beredar, terlihat lampu merah di penyeberangan jalan sudah merah. Tapi bukannya ngerem, pengemudi Alphard malah tancap gas. Eh pas ditegur satpam malah nggak terima. Haduuuuh~~~\n\nPadahal dalam UU no.22 tahun 2009 tentang Lalu Lintas dan Angkutan Jalan pasal 106 ayat 2 ditegaskan bahwa setiap orang yang mengemudikan kendaraan bermotor di jalan wajib mengutamakan keselamatan pejalan kaki dan pesepeda. Terus di pasal 131 ayat 2, disebutin bahwa pejalan kaki berhak mendapat prioritas pada saat menyeberang jalan di tempat penyeberangan. \n\nPolisi bilang kedua belah pihak sudah sepakat saling memaafkan dan berjabat tangan. \n\n“Sudah diselesaikan secara kekeluargaan dibantu mediasi oleh Kapospol di Polspo Thamrin,” ujar Kapolsek Metro Menteng AKBP Braiel Arnold Rondonuwu. \n\nCreator: Dina Rayanti\nEditor: Mohammad Wildan", "user": {"strong_id__": "2701519612", "pk": "2701519612", "pk_id": "2701519612", "id": "2701519612", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841402868367689", "username": "detikoto", "full_name": "detikOto", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "2504995646534508175_2701519612", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-gru1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/147377549_740986836809478_4805772744715699581_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43NTAuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-gru1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gENgKala6FTdS7FIX_hhsoRnwi0aWCTjlxG1GBBXcvkNcH6Z4d2jVGCPmDq5d27VIk&_nc_ohc=UCuhPR4mSfAQ7kNvwEdHx_h&_nc_gid=xbyeto17hKPn6C-4ENRN7Q&edm=ACWDqb8BAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQBiRJJHrro76dMUq90Y8sb_VZhpWHIXLdzAlJe3uobkrw&oe=6A679CD9&_nc_sid=ee9879"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "In CCTV video circulating, the red light at the crossroad is already red. But instead of braking, Alphard's driver just hit the gas. Eh, when the security guard reprimanded, he didn't accept it. Haduuuuh~~~\n\nWhereas the Act no.22 of 2009 on Traffic and Road Transport article 106 verse 2 states that everyone driving a motor vehicle on the road must prioritize the safety of pedestrians and cyclists. Continue in article 131 verse 2, it is stated that pedestrians have the right to get priority when crossing the road at the point of crossing.\n\nPolice say both sides have agreed to forgive each other and shake hands.\n\n\"It has been resolved as a family with the help of mediation by Kapospol in Polspo Thamrin,\" said Kapolsek Metro Menteng AKBP Braiel Arnold Rondonuwu.\n\n Creator: Dina Rayanti \nEditor: Mohammad Wildan"}, "comment_count": 1752, "comment_likes_enabled": true, "play_count": 668195, "ig_play_count": 668195, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "video_duration": 39.402000427246094, "is_dash_eligible": 1, "video_dash_manifest": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<MPD xmlns=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011 DASH-MPD.xsd\" profiles=\"urn:mpeg:dash:profile:isoff-on-demand:2011\" minBufferTime=\"PT2S\" type=\"static\" mediaPresentationDuration=\"PT39.402813S\" FBManifestTimestamp=\"1784787496\" FBManifestIdentifier=\"FtDIjaYNGBFpZ19kYXNoX2Jhc2ljX3ZwORlW/J/2+6ji9QSOy8XxqeL1BLi+3PSp4vUE4rHz96ni9QSMpYr7qeL1BCIYGGRhc2hfbG5faGVhYWNfdmJyM19hdWRpbyIsGRgObGF0YW1fbW9kZXJhdGUAFgAUABIUAgA=\"><Period id=\"0\" duration=\"PT39.402813S\"><AdaptationSet id=\"0\" contentType=\"video\" subsegmentAlignment=\"true\" par=\"9:16\" FBUnifiedUploadResolutionMos=\"360:79.4\"><Representation id=\"1384874876908231v\" bandwidth=\"354493\" codecs=\"vp09.00.21.08.00.01.01.01